    heroSeoText: 'Custom food packaging boxes from Packify carry restaurant, bakery, and grocery brands on grease-resistant kraft, freezer-grade coated board, and single-wall corrugated stock. Every format prints in CMYK with Pantone PMS matching, from fold-pail take out boxes to windowed dessert cartons. No MOQ, 8-10 business day production, and free shipping in Australia on every order.',
    learnMore: [
      { heading: 'Custom Food Packaging Built for Grease, Steam, and Cold', body: 'Food punishes packaging three ways: grease soaks board, steam softens structure, and freezer condensation attacks print. Packify matches the board grade to the threat: grease-resistant kraft for fried and sauced dishes, vented corrugated for hot delivery, and freezer-grade coated board that holds rigid below zero. Food-safe coatings cover every food-contact surface, and each dieline is proofed against the actual dish before production.' },
      { heading: 'Printing That Sells Food on Sight', body: 'Appetite is visual, so food packaging prints in CMYK at photographic sharpness with Pantone PMS matching that keeps brand color identical across reorders. Menu photography, ingredient callouts, and allergen text all place into the dieline proof before the run. Gloss lamination saturates food photography on retail cartons, and full-surface printing turns take out boxes into moving advertising through every delivery.' },
      { heading: 'Take Out and Delivery Formats for Every Kitchen', body: 'The take out range covers fold-pail Chinese boxes that open flat into plates, single hook cartons that close in one motion on a busy pass, collapsible front tuck boxes for upscale kitchens, vented pizza boxes, and corrugated catering carriers. Every format ships flat, folds without tape or tooling, and holds sauce-heavy dishes without leaks from kitchen to doorstep.' },
      { heading: 'Retail Cartons for Shelf and Freezer', body: 'Retail food cartons run on 18pt to 24pt SBS with die-cut windows that put the product in view, printed to planogram dimensions so brand blocks stay square across facings. Freezer lines use moisture-resistant coatings that stop condensation blurring artwork in the case. Regulatory text prints at legible sizes with placement locked in the dieline proof.' },
      { heading: 'No MOQ Food Packaging with 8-10 Day Production', body: 'There is no minimum order on any food packaging format: a single-location restaurant and a regional chain run the same specifications, dies, and Pantone targets. Production completes in 8-10 business days from artwork approval, free dieline and design support runs before every cycle, no die or plate charges apply, and every order ships free in Australia. Reorders reproduce the approved specification exactly.' },
    ],
